      "message": "feat(contour): user-set start point on closed 2D contours\n\nAn optional links.approach.start_point starts the nearest closed\ncontour ring at the pick's projection onto the cutter-centre path, on\nevery level, with the lead-in planned there. Refused by name, never\nmoved silently: a pick far from every ring, no lead-in fitting at the\npick, tabs, control/wear compensation, open chains, tilted contours and\nevery other operation kind. No pick keeps every path byte-identical.\nSaved in the project file only when set; the MCP edit_operation patch\nreaches it.\n\nRefs #1448\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
